error[jexpr::parser::array::consecutive-comma]: Consecutive commas in array
  ╭▸ 
1 │ ["a",,, "b"]
  │      ┯─ additional extra comma
  │      │
  │      consecutive comma is not allowed in arrays
  │
  ╰ note: array elements must be separated by a single comma
help: remove the extra commas
  ╭╴
1 - ["a",,, "b"]
1 + ["a", "b"]
  ╰╴
